---
title: Crab Delight Dip
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Appetizers & Dips
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@mayonnaise{1%c}
@chopped parsley{1%Tbsp}
@crabmeat{1%6 1/2-oz can} (drained, cleaned and chopped)
@sherry{1%Tbsp}
@lemon juice{1%tsp}
@sour cream{1/2%c}
@Salt and pepper

Combine all ingredients and chill 2 hours.
